{"id":"vod_bf_75735","vodId":"75735","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"K (2012)","name_cn":"K (2012)","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20241001-1/40a6a6779ea35694290272c176c67f05.webp"},"summary":"《K》是以革新作家集团「GoRA」的7名匿名作家的小说为原著。故事以与现实有着微妙历史差异的现代日本为舞台，描写了七位“王”各自的执着，以及被卷入其中的少年的命运与异能者之间战斗。“赤之王”周防尊所率领的吠舞罗与“青之王”宗像礼司所率领的Scepter4因追杀某起事件的嫌疑人：—名为小白的伊佐那社而互相对立。但小白对这件事却没有什么记忆，毫不知情的他逃避着来自两个集团追杀。而出现在这样的小白面前的是身着黑服的纤细长发少年——夜刀神狗朗。也正因为与他的邂逅，小白的命运从此走上了不同的轨道......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-01 23:19:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/K2012/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:11.177Z"}